    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d500-a1">

                <pb facs="0786" n="658" sameAs="frus:frus1885/pg658"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 21.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Campbell to Mr.
                            Bayard</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >New York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-05-18"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 18,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I beg leave to ask your careful
                    consideration of the inclosed narrative of Israel Müller, in whose case I feel
                    deeply interested.</p>
                <p>Will you please let me know at your convenience what steps you may decide upon
                    taking in this matter and oblige,</p>
                <p>Yours, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>FELIX CAMPBELL, <hi rendition="#italic">M. C.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
